- action(n1, "Start"): Hallucinates a step not documented in the source; the text states "the process begins by filling in the passenger information".
- action(n5, "End process"): Hallucinates a step not documented in the source; the text states the process "concludes with INN320-Assignment 1-Payment V.1".
